    <string name="msg_printer_help">Follow these steps to connect the Zebra ZQ630 Plus:\n\n1. Turn on the ZQ630 Plus printer.\n\n2. Find the Bluetooth address of the printer. There are two ways:\n\n   • On the back (where the battery goes) there is a label with a barcode — the address is printed there.\n\n   • Or access the printer\'s Bluetooth menu to see it on screen.\n\n   Example: 8C:D5:4A:1C:0C:85\n\n3. On this screen tap \"Select printer\".\n\n4. The list of available printers with their Bluetooth address will appear. Select the one that matches the address from step 2.\n\n5. Tap \"Print test page\" to confirm it works.\n\nIf your printer does not appear in the list, verify that it is on and near the device.</string>
